### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### 2. Register an Admin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@portal.edu",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "System Administrator",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 3. Login as Admin (captures token automatically)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@portal.edu",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.token); %}

### 4. Admin Creates a Micro-Skill (Should return 201)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/admin/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ALG_LINEAR_EQ_1",
  "name": "Single-Variable Linear Equations",
  "description": "Solving equations of the form ax + b = c"
}

### 5. Verify Admin Isolation from Content (Should return 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 6. Register a Teacher
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher@portal.edu",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Dr. Elena Popescu",
  "role": "TEACHER"
}

### 7. Login as Teacher
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher@portal.edu",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("teacher_token", response.body.token); %}

### 8. Teacher Fetches Skills (Should return 200)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/assessments/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}